	(text "CSKB H1 + H2 Stack Connectors"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 154.94 105.41 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 3.048 3.048)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "e8ad183b-adde-4d47-9889-718f5e85f44c")
	)
	(text_box "CSKB stack connectors: 2× Samtec ESQ-126-39-G-D (2×26, 0.1″ (2.54 mm), stackthrough headers, one each for H1 and H2). Pin assignment locked to the Pumpkin CSKB H1/H2 convention — all boards in the centisat stack (EPS, FC, comms, payload) use the same H1/H2 pin numbers for the same signal classes. The comms board is a power CONSUMER on all power pins and a SPI SLAVE to the FC. COMMS_IRQ (H1.16) is driven by the comms RP2040 as a data-ready interrupt to the FC. I2C is shared between EPS LTC4162 (0x68) and comms Si5351A (0x60) — no address conflict. See system/interfaces/cskb_pinmap.md for the full canonical pin map."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 254 107.95 0)
		(size -48.26 40.64)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type default)
			(color 0 0 0 1)
		)
		(fill
			(type color)
			(color 255 255 150 1)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "14373818-df53-48cc-baf8-165dbf988e16")
	)
	(text_box "All test points are single-pad footprints accessible from the top side.  TP7 (SW_NODE) is critical for validating switching behavior -- use a short probe lead to minimize inductance.  TP8 (GND) should be a loop-tyle test point for easy scope ground clip attachment.  For production/flight boards, test points can be reduced to TP4-TP6 (VBAT, 3V3, 5V) plus GND."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 124.46 217.17 0)
		(size -53.34 22.86)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type default)
			(color 0 0 0 1)
		)
		(fill
			(type color)
			(color 255 255 150 1)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "36d1eeaf-b44e-407f-a1af-f760470f96dc")
	)
	(text_box "LED brightness at 3.3V: I = (3.3 - 2.0) / 1k = 1.3 mA (dim but visible).  \nLED brightness at 5.0V: I = (5.0 - 2.0) / 1k = 3.0mA. \n\nFor brighter LEDs, reduce resistor to 470 Ohm.  For flight, remove LED population or use DNP (Do Not Populate) -- LEDs waste power in orbit.  Mark all LED resistors as DNP-optional in BOM."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 116.84 181.61 0)
		(size -71.12 17.78)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type default)
			(color 0 0 0 1)
		)
